    <bpmn:process id="W_W2578" name="W2578. New Shared Service Establishment &amp; Cost Pool Setup" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New shared service identified or entity structure change
Frequency: Ad-hoc; 2–3 per year
Volume: 5 entities
Owner: Finance Controller
Participants: Finance Controller, VP of affected function, CFO
Source: workflow W2578 — New Shared Service Establishment &amp; Cost Pool Setup</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W2578_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W2578_Lane1" name="Finance Controller">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2578_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2578_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2578_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W2578_Lane2" name="CFO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2578_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2578_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W2578_Start4" name="New shared service identified or entity structure change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2578_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2578_Task5" name="Finance Controller evaluates new shared service request: cost pool definition…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Finance Controller evaluates new shared service request: cost pool definition, affected entities, allocation methodology proposal, transfer pricing implications; prepares business case with 3-year cost projection
Responsible (R): Finance Controller
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1–2 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2578_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2578_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2578_Task6" name="CFO and affected entity heads review proposal; negotiate allocation…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: CFO and affected entity heads review proposal; negotiate allocation methodology; agree on initial budget and annual review mechanism; external advisor confirms arm&#x27;s-length compliance
Responsible (R): CFO / Entity CFOs / Transfer Pricing Advisor
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: 1–2 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2578_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2578_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2578_Task7" name="Finance Controller configures new cost pool in ERP: creates shared service cost…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Finance Controller configures new cost pool in ERP: creates shared service cost center, defines allocation keys, sets up IC posting rules, establishes monthly reporting; trains cost center managers on timekeeping and cost attribution; first allocation run with parallel posting for validation
Responsible (R): Finance Controller / IT
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1–2 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2578_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2578_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W2578_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W2578_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W2578_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-445 (ensure controlled execution — Shared Services Cost Pool Management (PA-72.1).) | - CTL-445 (transfer-pricing arm&#x27;s-length — links to W235); operational: CEO sign-off on the new-service agreement; CFO sign-off on the go-live after parallel-run validation
Owner: Finance Controller</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
